          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatesile malile ni Isakala, kutyocela kungopoko lyuŵa mpaka kungapilo lyuŵa kuciŵa upande umo wa Sebuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatesile malile ni Sebuloni, kutyocela kungopoko lyuŵa mpaka kungapilo lyuŵa kuciŵa upande umo wa Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatesile malile ni Gadi mbali ja kum'mwela, malile gatandile ku Tamala kwitanda lya Meliba Kadeshi, kaneka kutyocela ku lusulo lwa ku Iguputo kuja ku Nyasa Jekulungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Cilambo cosopeco ni cele tinjicigaŵanya kwa mitundu ja Aisalaeli kuti ciŵe cakupocela cawo. Maupande gosopego tigaciŵa gawo. Ni yinguti Une AMBUJE Mlungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
