          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aji jiŵe milango jakopocela mu msinda: Mbali ja kumpoto, ulewu wakwe uli mamita 2,250, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuŵe yipata yitatu, Cipata ca Lubeni, Cipata ca Yuda ni Cipata ca Lefi, yipatayi yikolanjidwe ni mena ga mitundu ja Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungopoko lyuŵa, ulewu wakwe uli mamita 2,250, kuŵe yipata yitatu, Cipata ca Yosefe, Cipata ca Benjamini ni Cipata ca Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
